  "a request b declines, a second one b accepts, c's request a accepts, a nickname submitted with Enter, two favourites, Move down, Remove friend.",
  "The server: a new Access label, Require access labels, Manage member with the duration picker and a permanent grant, Kick (cancelled),",
  "Delete channel. Chat: pin, Pinned messages, Unpin, Message proof, Report user (cancelled, never sent). Voice: the switch confirm while",
  "someone is there, and no confirm leaving an empty room. The screen share picker (it thumbnails the HOST's real screens and windows).",
  "Settings > Security: the app password dialog and its mismatch, the backup export. Light theme and 150% zoom on three dialogs.",
  "b leaves the server, a deletes it. The fleet talks to the production relay; nothing here sends a report.",
  "run: powershell -File scripts\\fleet.ps1 -Scenario dialogs_after -Peers a,b,c"
